{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03019","headline":"将发还乡示诸弟 · 张九龄","name":"将发还乡示诸弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岁阳亦颓止，林意日萧摵。\n云胡当此时，缅迈复爲客。\n至爱孰能舍，名义来相迫。\n负德良不赀，输诚靡所惜。\n一木逢厦构，纤尘愿山益。\n无力主君恩，宁利客卿璧。\n去去荣归养，怃然叹行役。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03019.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03019","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}